# Backend Structure

## Stack

- Node.js
- NestJS
- Prisma
- PostgreSQL

## Architecture Layers

### 1. Modules Layer

Handles domain separation.

- transactions
- accounts
- debts
- investments

### 2. Domain Layer

Contains business rules.

- services
- rules
- validators

### 3. Analytics Layer

Handles intelligence.

- analysis services
- jobs
- insights

### 4. Infrastructure Layer

Handles technical concerns.

- database
- queues
- external APIs

## Folder Structure

```text
/src
  /modules
  /domain
  /analytics
  /infra
```

## Rules

- No business logic in controllers
- Services must be reusable
- Analytics must be isolated
